[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/333283368","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/19492#issuecomment-333283368","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/19492","id":333283368,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMzMzI4MzM2OA==","user":{"login":"alexzuza","id":4223314,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjMzMTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4223314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza","html_url":"https://github.com/alexzuza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-09-30T04:51:58Z","updated_at":"2017-09-30T06:54:06Z","body":"@tbosch I think the problem here is that new `TsCompilerAotCompilerTypeCheckHostAdapter`  [doesn't replace](https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/packages/compiler-cli/src/transformers/compiler_host.ts#L112-L113) `\\` to `/` for `containingFile` variable as [it was](https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/packages/compiler-cli/src/compiler_host.ts#L344-L346) in old `CompilerHost` so typescript can't find module because it uses `ts.directorySeparator`, which is `/`, to find `containingFolder`.\r\n\r\nPossible workaround is using `paths` options in tsconfig:\r\n\r\n```\r\n{\r\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\r\n    ...\r\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\r\n    \"paths\": {\r\n      \"@angular/core\": [\"node_modules/@angular/core\"]\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n```\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/333283368/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"alexzuza","id":4223314,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjMzMTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4223314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza","html_url":"https://github.com/alexzuza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1272637716,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MTI3MjYzNzcxNg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/1272637716","actor":{"login":"tbosch","id":690815,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MDgxNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/690815?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch","html_url":"https://github.com/tbosch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","s